<title>AUSTRIA: OMV Q1 EBIT 1.02 bln ATS vs 0.945 bln.</title>
<headline>OMV Q1 EBIT 1.02 bln ATS vs 0.945 bln.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian energy and chemicals group OMV said on Monday preliminary first-quarter earnings before interest and taxes (EBIT) rose to 1.02 billion schillings from 945 million a year ago.</p>
<p>The group, Austria's biggest industrial concern, said first-quarter sales were up at 21.45 billion schillings from 17.77 billion in the year-ago period.</p>
</text>
